            "link_url": "",
            "title": "Gaillet gratteron – Galium aparine"
          },
          "type": "item"
        },
        "item_Wn6R9g": {
          "settings": {
            "column_size": "4",
            "content": "<p>→ <strong>Le purificateur en profondeur </strong>Plante peu commune qui agit dans les <strong>tissus profonds</strong> pour <strong>dissoudre les déchets accumulés</strong>, à l’origine de la <strong>lourdeur</strong> et de la <strong>pression interne</strong>.</p>",
            "heading_tag": "h5",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CREA_1080X1080_-_2026-02-19T002053.831.jpg",
            "link_style": "link",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "title": "Stillingia – Stillingia sylvatica"
          },
          "type": "item"
        },
        "item_t7QbdB": {
          "settings": {
            "column_size": "4",
            "content": "<p>→ <strong>Le stimulant circulatoire </strong>Réactive la <strong>microcirculation</strong> et remet en mouvement les <strong>fluides stagnants</strong> dans les zones les plus sensibles : <strong>visage</strong>, <strong>mâchoire</strong>, <strong>chevilles</strong>.</p>",
            "heading_tag": "h5",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CREA_1080X1080_-_2026-02-19T002100.551.jpg",
            "link_style": "link",
            "link_text": "",
